BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Halcyon HX-220 User Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: prod-hx220-user-manual | Revision: C | Effective: 2025-09-01 | Owner: Halcyon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Product Engineering, Leeds | Applies to firmware 3.4.2) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Safety information) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (Read this manual in full before using the Halcyon HX-220 portable four-gas detector. The HX-220) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (is personal protective equipment. It warns the wearer of hazardous concentrations of oxygen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (deficiency or enrichment, flammable gas, carbon monoxide \(CO\) and hydrogen sulphide \(H2S\). It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (does not remove any hazard, and it cannot warn of gases for which it has no sensor fitted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (The HX-220 is certified intrinsically safe with the marking II 2G Ex ib IIC T4 Gb. It may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (used in Zone 1 and Zone 2 hazardous areas for gas groups IIA, IIB and IIC with temperature) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (class T4. It must not be used in Zone 0. The ATEX certificate is Baseefa23ATEX0031X and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (IECEx certificate is IECEx BAS 23.0017X. The lower protection level \(ib rather than the ia of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (the HX-210\) is a consequence of the larger 5,200 mAh battery and the radio module.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (- Charge the instrument only in a safe \(non-hazardous\) area, using the HX-DOCK-4 docking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (   station or the supplied single-unit charger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (- Replace the battery pack HX-BAT-220L only in a safe area. Do not use any other battery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (   pack.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (- Do not open the housing in a hazardous area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 441 Td (- Do not rub or clean the front label with a dry cloth in a hazardous area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 428 Td (- Substitution of components may impair intrinsic safety.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 415 Td (- Perform a bump test before each day's use. Calibrate at least every 150 days, or sooner if) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 402 Td (   a bump test fails.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 389 Td (- High off-scale readings of flammable gas may indicate an explosive concentration. Leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (   the area immediately.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (- Silicones, leaded petrol vapours, sulphur compounds and halogenated hydrocarbons can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350 Td (   poison the catalytic LEL sensor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (- The man-down and GPS functions are aids to lone-worker safety. They do not replace a site) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324 Td (   lone-working procedure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 308 Td (2. Product overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 286 Td (The Halcyon HX-220 is the connected member of the Halcyon family. It continuously monitors four) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 273 Td (gases and adds Bluetooth LE 5.0, GPS location, a man-down \(no-motion\) alarm and support for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 260 Td (optional motorised sampling pump HX-PMP-22. It shares its sensor platform with the HX-210, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 247 Td (the H2S, CO and O2 ranges differ.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 225 Td (The HX-220 is fitted with four sensors:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 203 Td (- Oxygen \(O2\): electrochemical, part number HX-SNS-O2-01, range 0-25% vol, resolution 0.1%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (   vol.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 177 Td (- Flammable gas \(LEL\): catalytic bead, part number HX-SNS-LEL-04, range 0-100% LEL,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 164 Td (   resolution 1% LEL, calibrated to methane \(CH4\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 151 Td (- Carbon monoxide \(CO\): electrochemical, part number HX-SNS-CO-03, range 0-1000 ppm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 138 Td (   resolution 1 ppm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 125 Td (- Hydrogen sulphide \(H2S\): electrochemical, part number HX-SNS-H2S-02, range 0-100 ppm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 112 Td (   resolution 0.1 ppm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 99 Td (The housing is rated IP67 and weighs 365 g including the battery \(without pump\). Dimensions are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 86 Td (131 x 70 x 44 mm. The operating temperature range is -40 to +55 C, the widest of the Halcyon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 73 Td (family, thanks to the low-temperature cell chemistry of the HX-BAT-220L.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
