stream
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 726 Td (3. Package contents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704 Td (The HX-220 starter kit, part number HX-220-KIT-05, contains:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (- 1 x HX-220 detector with four sensors fitted and calibrated at the factory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (- 1 x HX-BAT-220L rechargeable Li-ion battery pack, 5,200 mAh \(fitted\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (- 1 x single-unit USB-C charger with plug adapters) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (- 1 x calibration cap HX-CAP-220 with 1 m hose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 630 Td (- 1 x stainless steel belt clip and 1 x chest harness clip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (- 1 x hard carry case) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (- 1 x Meridian Link Mobile licence card \(Bluetooth app activation\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 591 Td (- 1 x printed quick-start guide \(see also prod-hx220-quick-start\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 578 Td (- 1 x factory calibration certificate) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 562 Td (4. Controls and indicators) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (The HX-220 has one large push button on the front \(ON/OK\) and two smaller buttons below the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 527 Td (display \(UP and DOWN\), identical in function to the HX-210. In addition, a recessed red PANIC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514 Td (button on the top edge triggers a manual man-down alarm when held for 2 seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 492 Td (- Two red high-intensity LEDs on the top edge flash during alarms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (- A green LED flashes once every 10 seconds as the confidence signal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (- A yellow LED lights when the calibration or bump test is overdue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 453 Td (- A blue LED flashes when Bluetooth is connected to a paired phone or gateway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 440 Td (- The sounder produces 103 dB at 30 cm, louder than the 95 dB of the HX-200 and HX-210, for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 427 Td (   use in noisy plant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 414 Td (- A vibration motor operates in parallel with the sounder.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 398 Td (5. Charging and power-on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (Charge the HX-220 fully before first use. A full charge from empty takes approximately 6.5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (hours at 20 C. A fully charged HX-BAT-220L pack gives a typical runtime of 22 hours at 20 C) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350 Td (with Bluetooth and GPS enabled and no alarms. With the HX-PMP-22 pump fitted, runtime falls to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (approximately 15 hours. Charge only between 0 and +40 C.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 315 Td (Power-on sequence:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 293 Td (1. Press and hold ON/OK for 3 seconds. All LEDs light, the sounder beeps and the motor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 280 Td (   vibrates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 267 Td (2. The display shows the firmware version \(3.4.2 for instruments shipped from September) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 254 Td (   2025\), the serial number and the instrument name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 241 Td (3. The display shows the alarm set points for each gas in turn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 228 Td (4. The display shows the days remaining until the next calibration and the next bump test.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 215 Td (5. The GPS icon flashes until a position fix is obtained \(typically 30 to 90 seconds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 202 Td (   outdoors\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 189 Td (6. The sensors warm up for 45 seconds, then the instrument enters measuring mode.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 173 Td (6. Display and navigation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 151 Td (The measuring screen layout and user menu are the same as on the HX-210, with two additional) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 138 Td (items:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 116 Td (- Menu > Wireless: switch Bluetooth on or off, pair a phone, and view the paired device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 103 Td (- Menu > Location: show the current GPS position and fix quality.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 90 Td (The menu closes automatically after 30 seconds without a button press. The instrument continues) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 77 Td (to monitor gas and will alarm while any menu is open.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
