10 0 obj
<< /Length 4000 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (inlet with a finger. The pump is not compatible with the HX-200 or HX-210.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 704 Td (11. Bump testing and calibration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (Bump test the HX-220 before each day's use, using MI-CAL-Q4-B at 1.0 L/min through the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (MI-REG-10 regulator, or automatically in the HX-DOCK-4. The bump test passes if each sensor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (reaches at least 80% of the cylinder concentration within 45 seconds and the alarms operate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 634 Td (The HX-220 must be calibrated at least every 150 days. It uses the same MI-CAL-Q4-B gas \(1.1%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 621 Td (vol CH4, 18.0% O2, 50 ppm CO, 15 ppm H2S\), flow rate and 120-second span stabilisation wait as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td (the HX-210 calibration procedure \(prod-hx210-calibration-procedure-v2\), except that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 595 Td (calibration interval is 150 days rather than 120 days. Calibrate with the pump removed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 582 Td (Docking-station calibration requires dock firmware D-2.1.0 or later.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 557 Td (12. Datalogging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 535 Td (The HX-220 logs readings from all four sensors and the GPS position at a 1-minute interval by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 522 Td (default. At a 1-minute interval the datalog holds approximately 180 days, twice the HX-210) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 509 Td (capacity. The event log records the last 1,000 events. Download logs with the HX-DOCK-4 or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 496 Td (Meridian Link 4.2 or later.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 471 Td (13. Maintenance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 449 Td (Clean with a damp cloth and mild detergent only. Replace the dust membrane HX-MEM-220 every 6) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 436 Td (months. Check remaining sensor life at Menu > Instrument > Service > Sensor Life, as on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 423 Td (HX-210.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 401 Td (The rear housing of the HX-220 is held by eight captive Torx T10 screws, tightened in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 388 Td (diagonal pattern to 0.45 N m. The rear gasket is HX-GSK-220 and is not interchangeable with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 375 Td (HX-210 gasket.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 350 Td (14. Supervisor settings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 328 Td (The factory default supervisor passcode for the HX-220 is 2207. Change it on commissioning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 315 Td (using Menu > Supervisor > Security > Change Passcode. After five incorrect entries the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 302 Td (supervisor menu is locked for 10 minutes. The calibration interval can be set between 30 and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 289 Td (150 days.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 264 Td (15. Troubleshooting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 242 Td (Error codes are listed in the Halcyon Error Code Reference \(sup-halcyon-error-codes\). Codes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 229 Td (specific to the HX-220 are E-113 \(pump flow fault\) and E-131 \(Bluetooth module fault\). Firmware) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 216 Td (3.4.2 is an HX-220-only maintenance build; do not attempt to load it on an HX-210.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 191 Td (16. Technical specifications) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 170 Td (Parameter | Value) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 158 Td (Model | Halcyon HX-220 connected four-gas detector) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 146 Td (Gases and ranges | O2 0-25% vol; LEL 0-100% LEL \(CH4\); CO 0-1000 ppm; H2S 0-100 ppm) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 134 Td (Resolution | O2 0.1% vol; LEL 1% LEL; CO 1 ppm; H2S 0.1 ppm) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 122 Td (Sampling | Diffusion; optional HX-PMP-22 pump, 0.5 L/min, up to 30 m tubing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 110 Td (Battery | HX-BAT-220L, 5,200 mAh Li-ion) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 98 Td (Runtime | 22 h typical at 20 C \(approx. 15 h with pump\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 86 Td (Charge time | 6.5 h) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 74 Td (Calibration interval | 150 days maximum) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 62 Td (Certification | ATEX II 2G Ex ib IIC T4 Gb \(Baseefa23ATEX0031X\); IECEx BAS 23.0017X) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
